{"title": "Elven Chain (passive feature)", "pageid": 30406, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Elven_Chain_(passive_feature)", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">For the medium armour, see <a href=\"/wiki/Elven_Chain\" title=\"Elven Chain\">Elven Chain</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Elven Chain</b> is a passive feature that lets anyone wear this armour.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You are considered <a href=\"/wiki/Proficient\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficient\">Proficient</a> with this armour while wearing it. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elven_Chain\" title=\"Elven Chain\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e6/Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Elven_Chain\" title=\"Elven Chain\">Elven Chain</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714211132\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 850/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6268/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1204/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 689010/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   33.067      1 -total\n 98.70%   32.636      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 53.22%   17.597      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 47.50%   15.707      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 43.96%   14.535      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 23.85%    7.885      1 Template:Item_icon\n 11.70%    3.868      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.97%    3.629      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 10.80%    3.571      1 Template:Hidden_code\n  9.58%    3.169      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30406-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714211132 and revision id 165626. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}